    "caveats": [
      "The 100 mm channel cannot meet both constraints (τ = 6.0 s exactly at 1.0 Pa); length was increased to 150 mm to give τ = 9.0 s. Confirm your device can accommodate a 150 mm channel.",
      "hCMEC/D3 forms only a moderately restrictive barrier (TEER 100–240 Ω·cm², ~10× below physiological BBB ~1800–2000 Ω·cm²). For a tight barrier, add astrocyte/pericyte co-culture or use a primary source.",
      "Verify the syringe pump can deliver 40 µL/min stably and handle the ~3 kPa back-pressure.",
      "Confirm medium viscosity ≈ 1e-3 Pa·s; serum-containing medium may be slightly higher, shifting shear.",
      "Seeding density of 1e5 cells/cm² is a starting assumption — validate confluence and barrier formation (TEER) before dosing."
    ]
